          "type": "Float"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "ApplyUniformForce\nThis function will dispatch a command to the physics thread to apply\na uniform linear force on each particle within the simulation.\n@param Enabled Is this force enabled for evaluation.\n@param Direction The direction of the linear force\n@param Magnitude The size of the linear force."
    },
