        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "SetDynamicState\nThis function will dispatch a command to the physics thread to apply\na kinematic to dynamic state change for the particles within the field.\n@param Enabled Is this force enabled for evaluation.\n@param Position The location of the command\n@param Radius Radial influence from the position"
    },
    {
